### 4. Autocomplete API
```
GET https://bazocam.net/search.php?PASS=BEYZA&action=suggest&q=SORGU
```

**Örnek:**
```
https://bazocam.net/search.php?PASS=BEYZA&action=suggest&q=aleyna
```

**Dönen JSON:**
```json
["aleyna tilki", "aleyna tilki remix", "aleyna kalayçıoğlu", ...]
```

**Cache:** Yok.

**Proxy:** Kullanılmaz — Google'ın suggestqueries.google.com API'si kullanılır.

